Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:34.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(730,690)\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H6D54D0&\b1\pos(321.231,156.453)}Episode 11 {\fs14}"{\c&H89CAEB&}Brother {\c&H6D54D0&}and Sister"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.88,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Aren't your parent-teacher meetings today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:35.67,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:37.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Did you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:42.74,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yes, please. I wanted more time to sleep,\N so I didn't eat on my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:44.87,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,If you go to bed now,\Nwill you be up in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:50.38,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, I think so. Let's see...\NLet me go over things one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.82,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yuta-kun, yours is at 4:20, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:54.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:58.60,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,And Saki... yours is 4:40? \NDid I get that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:01:59.64,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.52,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,You really won't get much sleep, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:04.88,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'll be fine as long as I'm up by 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:11.02,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,The only problem is that no one\N will be home around that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.84,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,If you want, I can give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.78,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Taichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:20.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad has work, too. Don't impose on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:24.03,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,It's fine! It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:28.11,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Then I'm counting on you \Nfor a very harsh wake-up call!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:28.78,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:37.15,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:42.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Nothing. Just killing time. \NMy meeting is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.30,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Ah, you too, huh? What time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:47.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,4:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:49.62,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Oh, ours are close. Mine's at 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:55.05,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,But if it's that late, \Nyou could've gone home first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:56.76,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I know Saki did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:05.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H9B8C75&\b1\pos(320,303.539)}I have to go home because I forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:09.50,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord1\blur4\c&H9B8C75&\b1\pos(320,303.539)\3c&H3E3D33&}I'll go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.00,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord1\blur4\c&H9B8C75&\b1\pos(236.7,303.539)\3c&H3E3D33&}and wake Mom up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:16.00,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord1\blur4\c&H9B8C75&\b1\pos(320,303.539)\3c&H3E3D33&}and wake Mom up, so don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:19.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H5F4F99&\b1\pos(275.3,303.539)\3c&H3E3D33&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:21.26,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H5F4F99&\b1\pos(320,303.539)\3c&H3E3D33&}Thank you! Appreciate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.26,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hey, are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:24.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, er, sorry. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:29.74,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I was just saying... you're into Saki, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:30.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.35,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Is that the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:36.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You know that Ayase-san and I are siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:42.03,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,You still call her "Ayase-san" even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:46.19,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,But you're only stepsiblings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:51.28,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,And that practically just happened,\Nso aren't you basically like strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:53.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm telling you it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:56.24,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,It's not, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:05.06,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Then is it okay if I root for someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:11.44,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,If I know another guy likes Saki,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:15.12,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,is it okay if I try to set them up? \NThat's what I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:21.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's not really something you\N should be asking my permission for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.39,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:25.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:33.69,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,So you two never ran into\N each other at school before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:39.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,We probably did. I just don't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:43.72,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,What a gentleman. \NYou don't ever stare at the pretty girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:47.24,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That wouldn't go over well these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:50.49,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you don't get any\Nfunny ideas, I don't think they'd mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:53.97,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Can you really tell if someone's\N got funny ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:55.73,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You sound so certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:05:01.86,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It's fine. If there's a misunderstanding,\Nyou just have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You've got thick skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:06.85,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:07.99,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.70,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yuta-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:14.12,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'll do my best, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:28.98,Default,Suzuki-sensei,0,0,0,,So, in summary, \Nif he keeps working this hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:32.50,Default,Suzuki-sensei,0,0,0,,he shouldn't have any trouble getting \Ninto a famous university in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.64,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:40.70,Default,Suzuki-sensei,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's because you did \Nan excellent job bringing him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:43.32,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm very grateful to my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:49.99,Default,Suzuki-sensei,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:54.61,Default,Suzuki-sensei,0,0,0,,Next, you just need to decide \Nwhere you'd like to apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:58.10,Default,Suzuki-sensei,0,0,0,,You'll get my stamp of approval \Nwherever you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san's classroom is this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:09.63,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'd better hurry. Also, thank you \Nfor what you said, Yuta-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.01,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you see me as your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:14.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, please don't pull on my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:17.62,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'm getting all teary-eyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.26,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yuta-kun, what do you want for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.24,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:26.09,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,F-First, would you mind letting me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.90,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,If I'm perfectly honest with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:36.08,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,I was somewhat worried about \NSaki-san during the first term.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:40.19,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,There were some unpleasant rumors \Ncirculating about her behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:44.72,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,However, I see things differently now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:51.46,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,I could tell by observing Saki-san that \Nshe isn't anything like the rumors say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:55.72,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,I know there are other teachers who say \Nthis or that about her appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:59.82,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,but I understand wanting\N to dress up and look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:02.98,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,I'll just say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:07.35,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,Try to keep it within appropriate\Nbounds for a high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.36,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:13.62,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk about your future plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:19.12,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,Your problematic language arts grade \Nstarted to improve in the second term.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:22.41,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,Have you thought about colleges \Nyou'd like to apply to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:26.14,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'd like to find one with low tuition costs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:30.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,that will put me in a good \Nposition for the job market.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:37.39,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,How about Tsukinomiya Women's College?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.34,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Tsukinomiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:44.36,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I've heard it's very prestigious. \NI'm not sure I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:48.64,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,With your current performance, \NI think you have a shot if you work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:51.54,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,It would definitely give you \Na boost on the job market.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:59.16,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,It's a public school, so tuition is low. \NIt might be exactly what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.92,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'd never even considered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:04.88,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,Why not go and see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:10.35,Default,Sato-sensei,0,0,0,,Look. They even have an open\N campus event this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.68,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Appropriate bounds, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:21.75,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I think if you try to stay too appropriate, \Nyou drive yourself nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:24.44,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.69,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:29.00,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,So, what'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll go tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:36.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll check out the open campus by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:39.20,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:45.07,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Tsukinomiya, huh? I'm so thrilled that \Nboth of my children are such good students!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:49.54,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yuta-kun was told that he could \Nget into any school he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:50.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:55.70,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,And listen to this! Yuta-kun's \Nhomeroom teacher actually said...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:11.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\shad0\c&H000000&\3c&HD0DBE0&\move(238.769,241.07,229.538,199.847)}Reception
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:11.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\blur4\fs18\3c&H444242&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(478.105,232.758)}Saturday, September 26th
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:07.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yomiuri-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:11.86,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wow! You came to visit \Nmy college? I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:15.36,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,If you'd told me, I would've welcomed you in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:22.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\frx10\fry296\c&H47493D&\3c&H989A8E&\b1\pos(533.539,70.923)\frz1.814}O\NP\NE\NN\N\NC\NA\NM\NP\NU\NS
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.21,0:09:18.19,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It was a last-minute decision.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.19,0:09:20.92,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You came for the sample lecture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:22.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:27.69,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Good! There's still some time, \Nso let me show you all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:29.00,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:31.39,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:32.57,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.02,0:09:39.82,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,What have we here, Yomiuri-kun? Is this \Ndazzling young lady a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.35,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Kudo-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:46.65,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Kudo-sensei is giving today's \Nsample lecture on ethics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:50.36,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,This is Ayase Saki. \NShe works at the bookstore with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:55.60,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Kudo Eiha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:05.66,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I can tell you're struggling \Nwith something right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:12.38,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,We've got some time, so would you \Nmind joining me in my office?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.78,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I may be able to give you \Nthe answer you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.88,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Always hitting on someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:21.64,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Get on up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:47.07,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,To be honest, I've already heard\N a bit about you from Yomiuri-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:50.67,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,About me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:55.55,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Yes. More precisely, about the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:56.89,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:11:00.40,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Let me think... What was it she called him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.23,0:11:03.49,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you mean Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:06.89,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Ah, so his name's Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You had no idea, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.96,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Correct. I didn't know his name yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:18.44,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, Yomiuri-kun is actually\Npretty careful with personal info.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax.2\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fay.1\fax.4\fs12\b1\frz17.2\c&H4A4E50&\3c&H9CABB2&\frx16\fry8\pos(135.385,238)}Metaethics
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax.2\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fay.1\fax.4\fs10\b1\frz17.2\c&H4A4E50&\frx16\fry8\pos(43,291)\3c&H8E9C9C&}Kudo Eiha
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax.7\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H323938&\pos(269.539,124.154)\frz2.07}General Ethics
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:25.98,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I'll cut to the chase. You've fallen \Nfor Asamura-kun, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:31.08,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,However, according to \Nconventional ethical standards,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:33.44,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,he's someone you shouldn't have feelings for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:37.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:42.47,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Well, that's all the proof I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:51.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't think I like you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:53.73,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I do like honest girls, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:58.95,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,So? I asked you a question. \NDo you like Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:02.22,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think he's a good brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:07.47,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Not that kind of "like." I'm asking if \Nyou have romantic feelings for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:09.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:10.64,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,But you're not related.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:13.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,A stepbrother is still a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:18.49,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Yet he's only been one for three short months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:27.30,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.06,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Asamura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Going to lunch, Fujinami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:36.10,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Yes, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:41.61,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,since you came to sit near me, \NI thought maybe you had something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:46.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, but it isn't really\N anything important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:50.88,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,It isn't? Are you going anywhere for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:53.37,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I was thinking the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:57.42,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Me, too. We can eat in the lounge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:12:59.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax.3\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\frz20.29\c&H6D726D&\3c&HEAEFEB&\b1\pos(283.693,160.462)}Egg Salad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.63,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax.3\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad0\frz20.29\pos(197.539,88.462)\c&H6D726D&\3c&HD4DAD7&\b1}Egg Salad
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.88,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\bord0\fay-.1\shad0\c&H394544&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(35.077,249.077)}Sockeye\NSalmon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.88,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\fay-.1\bord0\shad0\c&H394544&\pos(330.461,220.154)}Kelp
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.88,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs8\bord0\fay-.1\fax-.1\shad0\c&H394544&\3c&HFFFFFF&\b1\pos(564.532,193.804)}Spicy Cod Roe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:17.11,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,And that's what changed for \Nyou over these three months?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:25.53,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I think we have a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:28.73,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:32.47,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,What if those aren't romantic feelings at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:33.24,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:35.97,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Hey, relax. Let's just think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.97,0:13:38.21,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,According to what Yomiuri-kun told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:43.32,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,it sounds like your personal \Nstyle is to come off strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:47.87,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,But for you, the way you dress\Nis performative, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:53.47,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,You use fashion as a way to show yourself off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:14:01.21,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Your appearance is something\Nyou've constructed very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:05.61,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,However, though you're still a high schooler \Non the inside, the fact that you came
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:10.74,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,to see a top college makes me think\N you're much more serious than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.92,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It was recommended to me \Nat a parent-teacher meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.34,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,The persona you're showing off to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:21.75,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,wouldn't come visit a school like this \Njust because a teacher told her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:31.67,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to act like some easy girl, \Nand I don't want people to think I'm one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:38.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I just want to prove that I can use what \NI have to look "cute" or "pretty" or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,and for people to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:48.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And I didn't come today \Nbecause I'm a serious student.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:55.30,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I just thought it might help me\Nmake the best life I can for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:15:02.39,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm trying to convince myself that it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.63,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:12.90,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Your seemingly contradictory \Nappearance and personality
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:16.68,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,are both things you've crafted intentionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:20.84,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,But I'll also add this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:26.34,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,You're the kind of person who absolutely \Ndoesn't want others seeing her weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:34.22,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Listen, I can tell you're the type who's \Nalways fighting. Always by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:39.38,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,The stronger the fight, \Nthe more you need love and approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.53,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,So when shown the \Ntiniest gesture of support,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.96,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,you immediately get attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.94,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I was actually going to turn you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:52.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Turn me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:55.78,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I was gonna say, "I come to \Ncram school to study, not for that."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So you thought I was hitting on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:02.30,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,But it doesn't seem that way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:06.65,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,As soon as we started eating, \Nthe conversation hit a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:15.86,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't go to school, \Nso people think I must be really easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:18.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You don't go to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. You don't have to go into detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:26.94,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,It's all right. To be clear, \NI don't go to school during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, you go to night school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:35.72,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,If I say "night school," "female," \Nand "hangs out in arcades at midnight,"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.87,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,what kind of person would you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:45.36,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'd just think she's a night school student \Nwho goes to arcades late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:48.28,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Would you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:50.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:54.58,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You wouldn't hit on me because \Nyou thought I was an easy lay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:17:01.09,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't know anyone else \Nwho goes to night school,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:03.75,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,so I don't have any preconceptions about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:06.29,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:12.32,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I like that you're so unbiased. \NDo you look at everything impartially?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:16.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I think I make an effort to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:29.12,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I'd bet that you know very few people who \Ntruly understand who you are deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:35.88,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,That's why, arbitrary as it was, you fell for \Nsomeone who suddenly appeared by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:36.82,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:42.99,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Not what happened? \NCan you say that with confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:47.95,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,You should try engaging \Nwith a wider variety of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:53.73,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,You might find someone else\Nyou're drawn to one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.72,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,and that may help you resolve \Nthese issues without all the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.11,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I should meet someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:03.75,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you to go out and find a lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:07.84,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,But a limited perspective is the \Nenemy of reason and intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:11.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think I can agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:12.71,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.34,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:22.42,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,If you connect with another \Nperson you're attracted to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.83,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,and your feelings remain unchanged,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:34.26,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,then those are your true feelings, \Nand you should always treasure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:42.65,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:48.56,Default,Kudo,0,0,0,,There you go. It's also important \Nnot to be so stubborn, Saki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:52.73,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Would you mind calling me Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:16.30,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1860,1400)\move(290,78,138,78)\fnArial\fs10\fay.05\b1\shad0\c&H9BA29A&\3c&H454C3E&}Taboos in Ethics                coupled siblings               Ethics in Contemporary Society\Nculture, customs ->            children from different parents                                   values\N \h\h\h\hchange over time           ancient times                                           society ≠ individual\Nsneaking in                         Egypt, Greece, Persia, Japan                    revision of ethics
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:16.30,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(1860,1400)\move(290,78,138,78)\fnArial\fs10\fay.05\b1\shad0\c&H9BA29A&\3c&H454C3E&}consanguineous marriage                  today
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.69,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Will you be in the study \Nlounge again tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:35.10,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I have afternoon classes on the weekend,\N but in the morning, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:41.00,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Then we should eat lunch again. \NI know a good, cheap restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:48.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um, you didn't see a rice ball you \Nwanted at the convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:52.04,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You were watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:52.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:57.34,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Well, with rice balls, th-the seaweed \Nsticks to your teeth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.54,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,So I passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.22,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:13.23,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs18\shad0\bord0\fay-.11\c&HB9B4A9&\pos(402.667,158)}Asamura\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAyase
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:15.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? And Yomiuri-senpai was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:18.00,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah. She was working reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:21.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So she goes to a top women's college...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:25.41,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,There was also a really weird professor there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:26.24,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.81,0:20:32.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how else to describe her. \NWe kinda got into an argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I was exhausted by the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But you had fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:39.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:43.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are you thinking of going to Tsukinomiya now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:46.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think at college,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:50.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,it all begins when you start to realize\N how you think about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:53.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Like a place you go to work things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:57.40,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I do think I want to give it a shot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:04.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So what about you, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Will you keep going to that study lounge?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.09,0:21:11.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:16.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to meet a friend from \Ncram school for lunch again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:18.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.51,0:21:21.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That's great, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:23.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:29.51,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,She's right. This should \Nactually be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:34.43,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san met someone who \Nmade her want to try college,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:39.69,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,and I found a friend \NI can talk to at cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:45.67,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,We're both making new connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:49.45,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,This is how things should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:54.45,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,We each have our own separate plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:57.55,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,and our paths don't overlap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:04.39,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Bit by bit, we're getting closer \Nand closer to becoming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:09.97,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,a perfectly normal seventeen-year-old\N brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8678DF&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 12 {\fs14}"\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H89CAEB&}and{\c&H8678DF&}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h"
